   (plus any runtime declared under `spawn.runtimes`); Gemini, Muse, Agy, and
   an effortless Claude model take no `--reasoning-effort` at all.
   Treat the v3 `admitted_pairs` set the
   preflight reports as the exact admission authority, not `allowed_models`,
